e": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le03ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le03ob06re2img02.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le03ob06re2img02.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn5le03ob06re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: Let's talk about workplace safety. Injuries such as burns and scalds are common in restaurants. It's important to take precautions when working especially with the deep fryer. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I read that many burns are a result of those. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: Actually, when I started working in the restaurant industry, I had a small accident. <br>", "id": 1, "time": "2"}, {"image": "engenn5le03ob06re2img09.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What happened?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: You'll notice the area in front of a fryer gets lots of grease around it. I had a slip and fall accident. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did you hurt yourself badly?", "id": 2, "time": "19000"}, {"image": "engenn5le03ob06re2img08.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: No, I didn't. Remember to be careful. Any other questions?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How do you avoid getting any scalds? There's lots of hot liquids in the kitchen.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: Of course. Just follow all safety procedures when cooking with hot liquids. Read through the manual.", "id": 3, "time": "29000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa's Stories", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "What Happened?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe plans for the organization of events.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking about Injuries", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Burns are common injuries. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Burns are injuries to the body's tissues (material that is made up of cells) caused by heat.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Scalds are a type of burn.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Burns are grouped according to how much the tissue is damaged.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Type of Burn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What Happens?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"first degree burn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>redness </li><li>swelling in top layer of skin</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"second degree burn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>redness </li><li>swelling </li><li>blistering of skin</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"third degree burn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>damage of all layers of skin </li><li>scarring</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Injuries such as burns are common in restaurants.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "How do you avoid getting any scalds? ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Quantifiers ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use quantifiers to talk about the quantity or amount of something.<br><br>  A quantifier can be general or specific. A general quantifier talks about that thing in a general way. A specific quantifier has more information. It refers to a specific example of that thing.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"General Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Specific Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All<br> Most<br> Many<br> Some<br> Any<br> A few<br> A lot of<br> A couple of<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of <br> Most of<br> Many of<br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A few of<br> A lot of (the ... )<br> A couple of (the ... )<br> None of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Non-Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All<br> Some <br>Any<br> A little <br>Much<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of<br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A little<br> Much of<br> None of\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Most equipment helps prevent accidents.</span> (Non-Count - general) ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "All of the oil in the deep fryers is checked.</span>  (Non-Count - specific) ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Many burns are a result of deep fryer accidents.</span>  (Count - general) ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Some of these accidents result in serious injuries.</span> (Count - specific)", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "workplace safety ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "protecting the health of people at work  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Workplace safety is an important topic in the office. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about an accident. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "injury ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a wound or damage to part of your body ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Injuries are common in restaurants. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "burn ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an injury caused by fire ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Burns are heat-related injuries.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "scald ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a burn on your skin caused by hot liquid or steam ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How do you avoid getting a scald?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "precaution", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you do to prevent something dangerous from happening ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's important to take precautions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "deep fryer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an appliance that cooks food in hot oil ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Be careful when you use the deep fryer.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "grease ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an oily substance that comes off food made using butter or oil ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't slip on the grease on the floor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "slip and fall ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " losing your balance and dropping down  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I had a slip and fall accident.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "badly ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to a serious level  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did you hurt yourself badly?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "safety procedure ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a series of actions that are followed in order to be safe", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Just follow all safety procedures when cooking with hot liquids.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob06aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go on the Internet. Search common injuries in the workplace.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one (not burns or scalds).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 7-8 sentences about this injury. Answer these questions: <ul><li>How does it happen?</li> <li>What can you do to avoid it?</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I research a common injury.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my sentences aloud. ", "type": "text"}]}]}